{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366910/extras/\uba54\uc778.jpg?t=1742177300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leshy and the Magic Book are on a quest to unlock <strong>ancient animal powers,</strong> but the <strong>Red Panda Temple</strong> <strong>is overrun by slimes!</strong> Help Leshy crush the slime invasion and restore peace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366910/extras/SR.jpg?t=1742177300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u30fbSlime-Slaying Frenzy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive 15 minutes of non-stop slime smashing chaos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge exploding blobs, weave through bullet-hell madness, and conquer the ultimate slime overlord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366910/extras/\ub9c8\ubc95.jpg?t=1742177300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u30fbLeshy's Magic Arsenal!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness elemental magic\u2014<strong>Fire, ice, electricity, wind</strong> <strong>and more!</strong> Mix and match spells to create <strong>your own killer skill set</strong> and wipe out those gooey invaders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366910/extras/\ub8ec.png?t=1742177300\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u30fbGame-Changing Runes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boost Leshy's power with <strong>legendary runes!</strong> Spend hard-earned gold on <strong>epic buffs</strong>, then <strong>discover hidden upgrade shops</strong> to make them even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3366910?t